    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♏ Scorpio is ascendant today.</strong> Your Cloth is awake. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were <strong>4 levels higher</strong>, and you have your Ascendant Boon.</p><p>Needles land on <strong>any</strong> attack you make against a creature, hit <em>or</em> miss. Each needle deals @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage, stacking, <strong>capped at 10 needles</strong> of bleed.</p><p>At <strong>8 needles</strong> the creature must attempt a Fortitude save against your Cosmo DC or <strong>die</strong>. <strong>Incapacitation.</strong></p><hr /><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. Applied and removed by the module's sky tracker; a GM can also drag it on by hand.</p>"
